<title>USA: USDA - China adds soymeal, soy commitments Wk Oct 10.</title>
<headline>USDA - China adds soymeal, soy commitments Wk Oct 10.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday in its weekly export sales report that net soymeal sales to China for the week ending October 10 were 167,000 tonnes and soybean sales were 100,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The soymeal figure included new sales of 112,000 tonnes and switches of 55,000 tonnes from unknown destinations.</p>
</text>
